  "emoji": "🦜",
  "name": {
   "zh": "花衣鹦鹉",
   "en": "Pippa the Parrot"
  },
  "t": "你好！我是花衣鹦鹉。你看，我的衣服很漂亮，可是有点小。你想买什么衣服？",
  "r": "nǐ hǎo! wǒ shì huā yī yīng wǔ. nǐ kàn, wǒ de yī fu hěn piào liang, kě shì yǒu diǎn xiǎo. nǐ xiǎng mǎi shén me yī fu?",
  "zh": "",
  "en": "Hello! I'm Pippa the colourful parrot. Look, my clothes are pretty, but a bit small. What clothes do you want to buy?"
 },
